      "sc:description": "The dataset was generated by systematically sampling decoder-only transformer model configurations from a predefined architecture and training hyperparameter search space. Each configuration was used to train a language model on the SlimPajama dataset, and the resulting models were evaluated on upstream language modeling metrics. The collected records consist of model configuration parameters (e.g., number of layers, hidden dimension, attention heads, hyperparameters, learning rate, and training budget) together with their corresponding performance metrics. Data was automatically collected from training runs executed on GPU clusters. No human annotations or synthetic agents were involved."
